in multiple groups when you add labels, should have one label for each group instead of a single label in the model syntax.
You have this labesl in this

NeighInflu=~NeighInflu_Alc*Alc
NegPerCh=~NegPerCh_Alc*Alc
PeerInf=~PeerInf_Alc*Alc

Marij~Alc_Marij*Alc

NeighInflu~~VAR_NeighInflu*NeighInflu
PhysDis~~VAR_PhysDis*PhysDis

